I couldn’t modify the repository because the workspace is read-only and command execution is unavailable. The intended implementation is:

```python
def visible_reports(user_groups, reports):
    if not user_groups or not reports:
        return []
    groups = set(user_groups)
    return [report for report in reports if report["group"] in groups]


def list_user_reports(user, reports):
    return visible_reports(user["groups"], reports)
```

This preserves order, avoids mutation, and uses only the standard library.

